# Test-only database.
#
# Copy to apps/backend/.env.test and point it at a database used by NOTHING but
# the automated suite. Integration tests truncate and delete rows freely, so it
# must never be the runtime/canary database.
#
# Read only by tests/helpers/test-database.ts. The backend runtime, the worker
# and every operator CLI keep using DATABASE_URL from .env and never load this
# file.
#
# The helper fails closed rather than falling back:
#   - missing TEST_DATABASE_URL          -> integration setup fails
#   - same host/port/database as DATABASE_URL -> integration setup fails
#   - database name not ending in _test  -> integration setup fails
#
# Provision it with:
#   pnpm --filter @trading-alert-dashboard/backend test:db:setup
TEST_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:55432/trading_alert_dashboard_test?schema=public
